\label{AmalgamatedGraph}
	Let $\Gamma$ be a simplicial graph and let $\Delta\subset\Gamma$. Consider the amalgamated product $\Omega=\Gamma\ast_{\Delta}\stackrel{n}{\cdots}\ast_{\Delta}\Gamma$. Let $\Delta_1$ be a graph such that $\Delta\subset\Delta_1$ and $\widehat{\Delta}_1$ is contractible, and define $\gamma=\Gamma\ast_{\Delta}\Delta_1$. Then
	$$\overline{\beta}_i(\widehat{\Omega})=(n-1)\overline{\beta}_i(\widehat{\gamma})+\overline{\beta}_i(\widehat{\Gamma})\quad\text{for every } i\geq 0.$$

